cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or its figures, please cite this repository."
title: "The Commodity Factor Model: scarcity, carry and the shape of the oil and gas curve"
abstract: >-
  A visual, reproducible study of how physical scarcity shapes the oil and gas
  futures curve. The model relates a seasonal inventory z-score to the
  annualised slope of the curve, tested with controlled regressions, a
  common-factor null, state splits and an expanding-window walk-forward. The
  repository publishes the method, aggregate results and figures, and no market
  data.
